From: Destrudos6 <3411622425@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:32:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] 0052: Add in-app update checker for GitHub releases

Check the PipePipe-Bisub GitHub releases API from a new "Check for
updates" preference in the bisub settings page. Compare the bisub
run-number in the release tag (bisub-NN) with the one in
BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME. If newer, show a dialog with release notes
and a download button that fetches the APK and fires ACTION_VIEW.

Requires REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES and a dedicated FileProvider for
the cache dir.
